  "prefLabel": "Pas 206.06 Written or Electronic Comments",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pas 206.06 Written or Electronic Comments. Individuals may submit written or electronic comments to the board on proposed rulemaking actions any time from the time notice has been published until the end of the written comment period as set forth in the notice of rulemaking.\n\nSource. #8132, eff 7-30-04",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pas100-300.html"
